{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 171737, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 116026, "uid": 56174, "type": 4, "title": "地狱地铁-强", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1667893755, "updated_at": 1682010407, "updated_uid": 56174, "comment_at": 1675489934, "last_at": 1682010407, "comment_count": 4, "status": 1, "summary": "现版本T0推荐：队长技：战斗开始时对自己进行20秒的挑衅（地下城时，战斗开始时随机对我方5体进行20秒无敌）+N技能巨额回血基本解决开局需要存续DS条问题，以及生存问题（开局敌方免控30秒），大幅度提", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1164/56174/2022/10/8/59609.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 12, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5997, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "广东省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 7, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 171737, "content": "<div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">现版本T0推荐：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"77\" data-height=\"77\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_77/h_77/1164/56174/2023/3/21/355121.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_77/h_77/1164/56174/2023/3/21/355121.png\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">队长技：<span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); text-align: left;\">战斗开始时对自己进行20秒的挑衅</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">（地下城时，战斗开始时随机对我方5体进行20秒无敌）+&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">N技能巨额回血</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: bold;\">基本解决开局需要存续DS条问题，以及生存问题（开局敌方免控30秒），大幅度提升了各种体系的通关。</span></div><div></div></span><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div>随手录de，有点卡；</span><br><div><span style=\"\"><div class=\"video-play-wrapper\">\n                      <p class=\"video-title\"></p>\n                      <div class=\"img-video-div\"><img class=\"uploadVideoImg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1164/56174/2022/10/8/59609.png\" data-url=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1164/56174/2022/10/8/407229.mp4\" data-width=\"460\" data-height=\"746\" style=\"display: inline;\" data-title=\"\" data-is_hot=\"0\" data-isb=\"1\">\n                     <i class=\"icon-video-play\"></i>\n                      </div>\n                    </div><br>11.28更新文字版：</span></div><div><span style=\"\">1、难点：敌人眩晕技能多，只能无敌硬抗+fever后的ss秒一两个；<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">通过上层难度<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">6</span>0+DS量。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\">2、续DS量；全是奶很烦人，无敌忍耐反射生命链接</span></div><div><span style=\"\">3、难点：4刀阵容极其容易死亡；<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">60+DS量进入。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\">4、随意；</span></div><div><span style=\"\">5、随意；</span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\">6-10</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">开始最高血量3体-8000，生存压力剧增；</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">6、随意；</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">7、续DS量；</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">8、难点：洛基的禁疗+甄姬的永炎结合扣血机制，导致生存压力拉满；<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">6</span>0+DS量进入；若fever进入还会暴毙，增加一个奶or辅助或者利用连点器迅速打完fever。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\">9、续DS量；（魅惑偶有困惑）</span></div><div><span style=\"\">10、难点：两体消buff（狂暴消失后眩晕debuff并不会跟着消失）;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">6</span>0+DS量进入；<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">若fever进入还会暴毙<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">利用连点器迅速打完fever。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\">11、回复下血量，随意；</span></div><div><span style=\"\">12、硬仗（真的很硬）；续DS量；</span></div><div><span style=\"\">13、难点：水狗男的ns最高两体消buff，老板娘的ns最高一体消buff；<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">6</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">0+DS量进入且多次开局；</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">若fever进入还会暴毙<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">利用连点器迅速打完fever或者利用控制队伍先狗30秒。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"\">14、随意；</span></div><div><span style=\"\">15、难点：光盾不死可能在你通关一瞬间团灭续DS时buff过期的天子；死的一瞬间后台关闭游戏可以重来。</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">（续60+DS量进入下一难度）</span></div><div><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\">细节：</span></div><div><span style=\"\">1、每关结束会+2%的DS量</span></div><div><span style=\"\">2、释放DS时不操作时只增加8%的DS量</span></div><div><span style=\"\">3、偶尔操作失误时利用折损其他天子可以存续DS</span></div><div><span style=\"\">4、血量都过低时可以明天再打</span></div><div><span style=\"\">5、个人感觉第10关和第13关低中难度不怎么消buff</span></div><div><span style=\"\">6、地狱地铁木队核心是木狂暴；输出靠ppt+暴击拐；比光队弱的地方在于没有控制以及基本靠手动</span></div><div><span style=\"\">7、光队核心是光琴或者光琴人偶；输出控制靠艳后</span></div><div><span style=\"\">7、偶尔失误导致进行不下去可以不打，甚至几周不打都不影响，因为细工石完全跟不上</span></div><div><span style=\"\">8、目前顶级光队也不能自动强难度地狱地铁（光琴+艳后+茶杯+彼列+木奶猫）</span></div><div><span style=\"\">9、米莉亚和茶杯+木乃猫的buff有重叠，可以替换上另外的来配合米莉亚</span></div><div><span style=\"\">10、顶级火队只能自动弱难度</span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1164/56174/2022/10/8/59609.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 56174, "us